WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.458
Hi, I'm
Amy Poehler,

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:03.125
and I'm standing in front
of a bunch of books,

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.333
which means
I'm smart

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:05.958
and you have something
to learn from me.

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:07.041
Let's get started.

00:00:08.791 --> 00:00:10.625
In my class, we're
going to discuss

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:13.208
how these
improv principles

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:14.500
affect your
real life.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.708
It's for people working,
in relationships, parents.

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:18.958
You know, how
do you deal with

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:22.458
kind of the everyday
humanness of life?

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:23.375
Who's next?

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:24.958
I need to break up
with my boyfriend. 

00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:33.000
Can't be
halfway in. 

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.208
When you see someone 
half commit to something,

00:00:35.208 --> 00:00:36.333
hell is the
hallway, right?

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:37.708
You're just
kind of stuck

00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:39.708
straddling between
two worlds.

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.333
It limits you
from connection, 

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.208
experience, and being
in the present moment.

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:45.500
Don't bail on
your partners.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.791
So many sketches
at SNL bombed,

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:50.500
 but everybody held on
to that bucking bronco

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.791
until it rode
out of town.

00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:54.333
It is so hard to 
hang in, but man, 

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:55.791
people do
not forget that.

00:00:58.375 --> 00:01:00.375
I am a big proponent of doing
things before you're ready.

00:01:00.375 --> 00:01:01.875
You can watch
the parade go by

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:03.541
and you can say,

00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:05.666
“I'm just going to wait
for the perfect float.”

00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:10.875
But if we are all waiting to be 100%
ready, the parade will go by.

00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:13.041
I'm Amy Poehler,

00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:14.750
and this is
American Idol

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:15.875
MasterClass.

